 "is_closed": true,
 "creation-date": "2015-12-16",
 "description": "Our goal is to provide tools and specifications for creatives and agencies to create and distribute multi-format images. These are\r\nimages which contain metadata that lets them adjust to different sizes, depending of the format of the output device or the layout of the website it is used in. These images can be used to have a web-server automatically create the alternative versions needed for a responsive website. ",
